{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"身体无法维持紧张、积压的重量先释放而问题未消失，分别有H8、H12支持；仍然在乎且不能保证所珍惜的东西留下，则有H20、H23及原解释4支持，没有新增原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"越界\",\n      \"why\": \"克制和秩序带来的支撑、继续加力无法保证结果，以及真诚愿望与悲伤可以并存，都能在H5、H18、H20、M3和原解释2中找到，但将歌唱的展开具体解释为被压住的“委屈和思念”终于能够说出来，加入了所列依据没有明确支持的心理内容。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"舍不得而无法忽略正在过去、持续激动带来消耗、再次加力仍不能消除失去的可能，均分别得到H17、H18、H20、H21、M38及原解释7的支持，没有新增原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 4,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"快乐真实发生且与正在流逝的感觉并存，见H10和M23；亲近值得珍惜却不能保证永远留下，见H15、H20和M23，因此把注意力转向当下的珍惜而不要求它保证未来，是对已有因果的具体展开。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "65501aec-1033-40e2-adeb-7e550f6943ee", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T133729997737Z", "elapsed_seconds": 162.156, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:40:12.184412+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2b0e681d20b5226d6be33f6152428aef048227f0cd79923313110c292858b65f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "a